717 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 248 0 R /Rect [ 127.697998 469.646975 467.777985 745.166964 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure2) /TU (Flowchart outlining a review focused on EEG analysis and identification of Alzheimer's disease. It includes sections like background, theme, and body. Under AD Analysis Methods, components listed are participant background, channels, experimental protocol, characteristic form, and analytical methods. Discussion of results covers EEG biomarkers, brain regions, model analysis, and other biomarkers. Conclusion and trends lead to a vision emphasizing accurate diagnosis to alleviate social burden.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
718 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 248 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 305.423983 538.617004 395.183993 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure3) /TU (Flowchart outlining a research process. Websites used are Scholar Google and PubMed, with time limitations from 2018 to 2025. Queries focus on EEG, electroencephalography, and Alzheimer's Disease. Screening removes specific types of articles, leading to inclusion of 100 articles for LC-I and 41 for LC-II.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
