1589 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 267 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 636.642001 538.585999 745.634997 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure14) /TU (Flowchart detailing an EEG-based dementia analysis process. Sections include "EEG Preparations" outlining resting and tasking states with paradigms like oddball and vigilance tasks. "Preprocessing" covers artifact removal and EEG rhythms. "Features" discusses domains like time, frequency, and spatial. "Algorithms" lists machine learning, deep learning, and statistical methods. "Results" focus on classification and recommendations for identifying Alzheimer's disease, shown in light purple. The process involves control and dementia groups, with specific focus on different EEG rhythm divisions.) /Type /Annot >>
